+
+## New executable contract (all native NOT_RUN)
+
+`scripts/opportunity-v3/research-v3-author-response-loss-native.test.mjs` registers only AUO2409 v3 and EMC2383 v3 children under one parent, serial/fail-fast. It does not import an old test entry. Installer, metadata query, snapshot, initial source-profile check, and the legal firstseal/assign/packet/article/observation prefix are exact extracted fragments from6e0; copy-identities.json pins the bytes/lines. The prefix uses the original full draft fixture, same arithmetic, schema and synthetic observation; no claim-by-claim author or source-rights qualification is created.
+
+The unchanged local fixture restores capturedschema→financial50→pub26→candidate36→explicit LOCAL two-owner USAGE, then runs the frozen author union installer and original independent observer checks. This setup and two successful v3 input firstseals are necessary new-case prefixes, not a rerun/import of previous suites. `sourceProfile:author_packet` and the readonly source manifest/metadata check remain unchanged.
+
+A dedicated existing `createResponseLossLab` service_role connection runs receive composition RPCs. Exact finite signatures and request/revision/input/principal relations are asserted. Earlier READ/packet queries must have settled (`pendingCount===0`). Only when actual composition reaches `receive_research_author_result_v2` is the unchanged relay armed, immediately before its real query. There is one receive call and no receive retry. No wrapper throws after a successful forwarded response to imitate transport loss.
+
+The original relay requires one DataRow, exact SELECT1 CommandComplete, no ErrorResponse and ReadyForQuery I; holds the whole response; enforces forwarded0; and invokes the observer callback before dropping real sockets. Its original4MiB/4096frames/5s containment, fixed owned Unix socket/ssl=false/no-PGenv/password rejection and single-client limits remain unchanged. This harness has no new timeout/budget.
+
+The callback uses distinct read-only x.audit to select the unique actual result by exact assignment ID. It compares every persisted payload field with actual p_result, original tagged completeHash/completeCanonical byte count, invocation/assignment and receivedAt window. Full input ledger, all9 input-table hashes, source fence events/invalidations/seals, assignment rows and FD counters must be unchanged; only the single expected author-result insertion is allowed. Success requires the composition to reject with the *same actual PG error object*, actual query settlement, pending0, both real socket closes and observer-confirmed COMMIT. A gate error, timeout facade or ReadyI without this observer proof cannot pass.
+
+Both fixed old/new owned financial root paths are verified and removed; each actual path/absence is recorded privately. A distinct new tracked service_role connection performs two explicit `composition.readAuthorResult` recoveries. The finite whitelist contains only candidate-input READ, assignment READ, packet READ and result READ. Assign/receive/claim/prepare/seal/renew cannot run through it. Whole committed snapshots, original row/hash/clocks/input charge and FD counters must match after each read. Existing RPC deliberately omits persisted private invocation_id; the harness verifies its exact expected value before comparing every remaining persisted column. It does not generically filter unknown metadata.
